%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: YuriGetsGrilled
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852045
    - rid: 8164893166592852048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri yawns as she gets out of bed to start her day.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852046
    - rid: 8164893166592852047
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah, despite everything, I've managed to get a good night's rest.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852049
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah good, you're here and awake.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852050
    - rid: 8164893166592852052
    - rid: 8164893166592852051
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-um, is the Thalmor delegation already here?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852053
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: No, but we do expect them to arrive within the hour.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852054
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Come with me to my quarters; I've gathered everyone else who'll be attending
      to get our story straight.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852055
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Y-yes, of course.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852056
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852057
    - rid: 8164893166592852058
    - rid: 8164893166592852059
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Since we're all here, and we don't have time to waste, let's begin.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852060
    - rid: 8164893166592852062
    - rid: 8164893166592852065
    - rid: 8164893166592852070
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Full chronology of events?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852066
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: I suppose it all started with our expedition into Saarthal.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: This apprentice and her friend-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-um, my n-name is Yuri...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852067
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri and her friend managed to get themselves trapped and used an ancient
      amulet to break further into the ruin.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852068
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri unconsciously grabs onto the amulet she found in Saarthal, which
      she's been wearing ever since she put it on.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852069
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: We eventually came across what we now refer to as the Eye of Magnus,
      being guarded by ancient draugr-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Who, initially, channeled part of its power into himself to become nigh
      invulnerable.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Obviously, such a discovery would attract the interest of any self-respecting
      academic...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, I organized its retrieval after sending the apprentices back to inform
      Archmage Aren.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: My plans to research the Eye further were interrupted by the appearance
      of a Psijic Monk, the day after the expedition.
    ScreenActions: []
  playerChoices:
  - choiceText: 
    resultingSequence: {fileID: 0}
    conditions: []
